description: Rules for Zustand store files
globs: "**/stores/**/*.ts"
---

# Zustand Store Rules
- One store per domain: session-store, audio-store, transcript-store.
- State changes ONLY through actions. No direct state mutation.
- Session store implements state machine with explicit transitions.
- Include devtools middleware in development: devtools(store, { name: 'StoreName' })
- Type the store with interface, not type alias.
- Selectors for computed values: useSessionStore(state => state.isActive)
